            <ArticleTitle>Plaque Type Eryrhema Nodosum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>37-38</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three young females developed plaque type erythema nodosum. The underlying causes in them were tuberculosis chest, recurrent furunculosis and malaria respectively. All the three cases were under treatment at the time of development of erythema nodosum plaques and the onset was acute.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
